From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tseng <tseng.jayj@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:20:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wallet: stop logging true ring member and amount at level 0

tools::detail::print_source_entry logged, at LOG_PRINT_L0, the spend
amount, the real_output index, real_output_in_tx_index and every ring
members global output index, for EVERY input of EVERY transaction the
wallet constructed. Level 0 is on by default, so an ordinary wallet log
named the true spend inside each ring and the position of the real output
inside its transaction. That is the decoy set defeated, in plaintext, for
anyone who ever reads, ships or pastes a wallet log.

Inherited from the Monero base; not introduced by MeepCoin.

The helper and both of its call sites -- the non-RingCT path in
transfer_selected and the RingCT path in transfer_selected_rct -- are
DELETED. Demoting the level is not the fix: the leak would still be one
--log-level away, and a reviewer cannot see it in a log that was not
captured at that level.

Nothing about transaction construction or output selection changes. The
src.real_output and src.real_output_in_tx_index assignments are untouched:
they are required to build the transaction. Only the disclosure is removed.

Consensus, MeepHash, rewards, difficulty, the browser and the native helper
are not touched. Daemon behaviour is unchanged; this is a wallet-only patch.
---
 src/wallet/wallet2.cpp | 2 --
 src/wallet/wallet2.h   | 7 -------
 2 files changed, 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/wallet/wallet2.cpp b/src/wallet/wallet2.cpp
index 930aeac..7e3eed2 100644
--- a/src/wallet/wallet2.cpp
+++ b/src/wallet/wallet2.cpp
@@ -9982,7 +9982,6 @@ void wallet2::transfer_selected(const std::vector<cryptonote::tx_destination_ent
     src.real_output = it_to_replace - src.outputs.begin();
     src.real_output_in_tx_index = td.m_internal_output_index;
     src.multisig_kLRki = rct::multisig_kLRki({rct::zero(), rct::zero(), rct::zero(), rct::zero()});
-    detail::print_source_entry(src);
     ++out_index;
   }
   LOG_PRINT_L2("outputs prepared");
@@ -10210,7 +10209,6 @@ void wallet2::transfer_selected_rct(std::vector<cryptonote::tx_destination_entry
       src.multisig_kLRki = {.k = {}, .L = {}, .R = {}, .ki = rct::ki2rct(td.m_key_image)};
     else
       src.multisig_kLRki = rct::multisig_kLRki({rct::zero(), rct::zero(), rct::zero(), rct::zero()});
-    detail::print_source_entry(src);
     ++out_index;
   }
   LOG_PRINT_L2("outputs prepared");
diff --git a/src/wallet/wallet2.h b/src/wallet/wallet2.h
index b18e9d8..f58754f 100644
--- a/src/wallet/wallet2.h
+++ b/src/wallet/wallet2.h
@@ -2714,13 +2714,6 @@ namespace tools
       }
     }
     //----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-    inline void print_source_entry(const cryptonote::tx_source_entry& src)
-    {
-      std::string indexes;
-      std::for_each(src.outputs.begin(), src.outputs.end(), [&](const cryptonote::tx_source_entry::output_entry& s_e) { indexes += boost::to_string(s_e.first) + " "; });
-      LOG_PRINT_L0("amount=" << cryptonote::print_money(src.amount) << ", real_output=" <<src.real_output << ", real_output_in_tx_index=" << src.real_output_in_tx_index << ", indexes: " << indexes);
-    }
-    //----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   }
   //----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 }
